# Force LF line endings on configs that are consumed by hostapd, dnsmasq,
# systemd, etc. Windows-style CRLF breaks these tools silently — they
# interpret the trailing \r as part of the value (e.g. `driver=nl80211\r`
# becomes "invalid driver") and refuse to start the AP.
*.conf  text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
